=== ADAPTER_DESIGN ===
SignalAdapter centralizes typed signal.Store -> FSM-friendly primitive translation in one file.
Methods: NewSignalAdapter, Last, Gear, Speed, IsCharging, IsDriving, Locked, SoC, Position.
Gear/charge state go through fmt.Stringer (codec emits ftproto.* enums) and short-suffix normalization.
Numerics delegate to Store.GetFloat/GetBool which already enforce ValueKind.
All non-happy paths log at debug only and return zero/false to keep guards branch-free.
